      "long": "A painted scene depicts a woman with fair skin and reddish hair, wearing a long-sleeved olive-green dress, seated at a warm-toned wooden table. She holds an orange-brimmed hat in her right hand and gazes at it. To her left, three hat stands display distinct hats: a white ruffled hat with yellow accents, a large beige hat decorated with green and white floral elements, and a reddish-brown hat partially obscured behind her. A light blue frilled hat with a dark blue bow lies on the table before her. The background is composed of vertical strokes in deep blue and green hues, suggesting fabric or wall coverings. Brushwork is visible throughout, contributing to the textured appearance of surfaces and garments.",
